label "Agent sandbox isolation diagram"
region sb 20 40 200 170 "disposable · destroyed after run"
box run 46 70 148 40 "agent run" acc
box fs 46 140 148 40 "scoped filesystem"
box egress 264 60 76 120 "egress|allowlist"
box allowed 380 52 60 36 "allowed"
box denied 380 152 60 36 "denied"
arrow run egress
arrow egress allowed
line 340 160 376 170
cross 360 165
note "two boundaries matter equally — what can run, and what it can reach"
